+## Research Delegation
+
+Before answering a research-heavy question in-session, evaluate whether it should be
+dispatched to an agent instead.
+
+**Definition of research:** Pure information retrieval, audit, tradeoff analysis, codebase
+survey, or exploration that produces a written document — no code change committed.
+
+**Threshold:** If you estimate the research would take > ~10 turns to complete thoroughly,
+stop and dispatch via `/research` instead of proceeding in-session.
+
+**Action:** Invoke `/research "<the user's question>"` — this dispatches the work to an
+available agent (daisy/devon) who will write findings to a feature branch. Your token spend
+drops from ~200K (doing it yourself) to ~5K (the dispatch call). Keep your quota for PM work.
